## 3. KNOWN LIMITATIONS

1. **API Rate Limiting**: Yahoo Finance may throttle connections if scans are run excessively (e.g., >10 back-to-back full universe scans). A 3-minute cooldown is advised.
2. **Options Data**: Deep options chain metrics (Greeks) require active Dhan API connection; fallback indices will not reflect real-time Greeks via Yahoo.
3. **Hardware**: Core threading requires at least 4 CPU threads. Systems with 2 threads will experience UI delays.

